  "body_html": "<h1>Pure Strategy With Imperfect Information</h1>\n<p>For player $i$ in an imperfect-information extensive game, a pure strategy is a\nfunction assigning to every information set $P^i_k$ an action\n$$\n  a_i\\in A_i(P^i_k).\n$$\nA pure strategy profile again induces a unique terminal outcome, so every finite\nextensive game has an associated normal form.</p>",
